    <text><body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <p>
                    <pb n="1r"/>Sie finden, mein Lieber, die <lb/>neueren Versuche von dem
                        <placeName ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/H0010833 https://www.geonames.org/2660646">Genfer</placeName>
                    <lb/>Chemiker <persName ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/H0013823 http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q55065394">Macaire</persName> in <ref xml:id="a85c25f4-c856-4b99-9c25-f4c8565b99b6" corresp="#dedf7b87-356f-4605-9f7b-87356f560526" type="editorialNote"><persName ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/H0012873 http://d-nb.info/gnd/116442921"><choice>
                                        <abbr>Decand</abbr>
                                        <expan>Decandolle</expan>
                                    </choice>
                                </persName>
                                <lb/><choice>
                                    <abbr>p</abbr>
                                    <expan>pagina</expan>
                                </choice> 248–251</ref><note xml:id="dedf7b87-356f-4605-9f7b-87356f560526" corresp="#a85c25f4-c856-4b99-9c25-f4c8565b99b6" type="editorial"><bibl ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/UMGK74RV">Candolle
                            1832</bibl>, I, 248–251.</note> und <ref xml:id="e61fb28b-3b17-4544-9fb2-8b3b17f5444f" corresp="#e35485b4-998a-4e83-9485-b4998aae837b" type="editorialNote">1474–1476</ref><note xml:id="e35485b4-998a-4e83-9485-b4998aae837b" corresp="#e61fb28b-3b17-4544-9fb2-8b3b17f5444f" type="editorial"><bibl ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/UMGK74RV">Candolle
                            1832</bibl>, II, 1474–1476.</note><supplied cert="high">.</supplied>
                    <lb/>Lesen Sie doch auch <lb/><ref xml:id="c841278b-97d5-4dee-8127-8b97d55deefc" corresp="#cb593469-9bd9-4cce-9934-699bd9fcce42" type="editorialNote"><choice>
                                <abbr>p</abbr>
                                <expan>pagina</expan>
                            </choice> 152–166</ref><note xml:id="cb593469-9bd9-4cce-9934-699bd9fcce42" corresp="#c841278b-97d5-4dee-8127-8b97d55deefc" type="editorial"><bibl ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/UMGK74RV">Candolle
                            1832</bibl>, I, 152–166.</note>
                    <lb/>gegen <persName ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/H0004267 http://d-nb.info/gnd/1042458375">La Hire</persName>
                    <choice>
                        <abbr>u</abbr>
                        <expan>und</expan>
                    </choice>
                    <persName ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/H0012784 http://d-nb.info/gnd/120562324">Du <lb/>Petit Thouars</persName> (fibres
                        <lb/>descendantes<supplied cert="high">)</supplied>.
                    Mich macht <lb/>es nicht irre. Ich <lb/>glaube was Sie glauben<supplied cert="high">.</supplied>
                    <lb/>Wenn Sie vielleicht <lb/><bibl ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/UMGK74RV">diese Physiologie</bibl> nicht <lb/>besizen <choice>
                        <abbr>u.</abbr>
                        <expan>und</expan>
                    </choice> Sie auf der <lb/>Reise <subst>
                        <del rendition="#s">durch</del>
                        <add place="intralinear">darin</add>
                    </subst>
                    <choice>
                        <sic>laufen</sic>
                        <corr>lesen</corr>
                    </choice> wollen, <lb/>So nehmen Sie sie mit <lb/>nach <placeName ref="https://edition-humboldt.de/H0005565 https://www.geonames.org/2935022">Dresden</placeName>
                    <supplied cert="high">.</supplied>
                </p>
                <signed> AHt </signed>
            </div>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <p>
                    <lb/>
                    <address>
